# BeanNote

Keep `db.py`, `ocr.py`, `translations.py`, and `app.py` as the only Python modules.

- Local DB: `./data/beannote.db`. Production DB: `/app/data/beannote.db`.
- Deduplicate with `UNIQUE(name, roaster)` and `difflib.get_close_matches` at 80% before every insert.
- After user-facing changes: bump `VERSION` in `db.py`, append `CHANGELOG.md`, commit `snapshot: vX.Y.Z - <feature>`.
- Palette is Espresso `#3c2a21`, Terracotta `#b85c38`, Cream `#faf6f0`.
